  ($g560$cond_ex19_7$g560$, $g561$gap$g561$, $g562$advanced$g562$, $g563${"id":"cond_ex19_7","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":7,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"We should leave now if we want to get the bus. → It's ______ if we want to get the bus. (time)","answers":["about time we left","high time we left","time we left"],"explanation":"It's time + Past Simple: пора."}$g563$, 96, $g564$cond_mix$g564$),
  ($g565$cond_ex19_8$g565$, $g566$gap$g566$, $g567$advanced$g567$, $g568${"id":"cond_ex19_8","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":8,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"It would have been better if you hadn't told her that. → If ______ her that. (only)","answers":["only you hadn't told","only you had not told"],"explanation":"If only + Past Perfect: жаль про минуле."}$g568$, 97, $g569$cond_mix$g569$),
  ($g570$cond_ex19_9$g570$, $g571$gap$g571$, $g572$advanced$g572$, $g573${"id":"cond_ex19_9","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":9,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"It's a pity you missed the performance. → I ______ the performance. (had)","answers":["wish you hadn't missed","wish you had not missed","wish you had seen","wish you had been to"],"explanation":"Жаль про минуле: wish + Past Perfect."}$g573$, 98, $g574$cond_mix$g574$),
  ($g575$cond_ex19_10$g575$, $g576$gap$g576$, $g577$advanced$g577$, $g578${"id":"cond_ex19_10","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":10,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"If John doesn't turn up, we won't be able to finish the project. → We won't be able to finish the project ______ up. (should)","answers":["should John not turn","should John fail to turn"],"explanation":"Should + підмет + V — інверсія в умові."}$g578$, 99, $g579$cond_mix$g579$),
  ($g580$cond_ex19_11$g580$, $g581$gap$g581$, $g582$advanced$g582$, $g583${"id":"cond_ex19_11","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":11,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"She didn't buy a ticket for the theatre, so she is not coming with us tonight. → She would come with us tonight ______ a ticket for the theatre. (if)","answers":["if she had bought"],"explanation":"Мішаний тип: умова в минулому (Past Perfect), наслідок — зараз (would come)."}$g583$, 100, $g584$cond_mix$g584$),
  ($g585$cond_ex19_12$g585$, $g586$gap$g586$, $g587$advanced$g587$, $g588${"id":"cond_ex19_12","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":12,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"I am afraid John won't accept our offer. → I wish ______ our offer. (would)","answers":["John would accept"],"explanation":"Wish + would: хочемо зміни в чужому рішенні."}$g588$, 101, $g589$cond_mix$g589$),
  ($g590$cond_ex19_13$g590$, $g591$gap$g591$, $g592$advanced$g592$, $g593${"id":"cond_ex19_13","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":13,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"You should have told me the truth. → It ______ if you had told me the truth. (would)","answers":["would have been better"],"explanation":"It would have been better if + Past Perfect."}$g593$, 102, $g594$cond_mix$g594$),
  ($g595$cond_ex19_14$g595$, $g596$gap$g596$, $g597$advanced$g597$, $g598${"id":"cond_ex19_14","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":14,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"As long as you have a ticket, you'll be allowed on the train. → Unless you have a ticket you ______ on the train. (not)","answers":["will not be allowed","won't be allowed"],"explanation":"Unless = if … not: після unless ствердна форма, у наслідку — will not."}$g598$, 103, $g599$cond_mix$g599$),
  ($g600$cond_ex19_15$g600$, $g601$gap$g601$, $g602$advanced$g602$, $g603${"id":"cond_ex19_15","level":"advanced","group":19,"gord":19,"no":15,"instruction":"Complete the sentences using the words in bold. Use two to five words.","prompt":"You had better take an umbrella with you. → If I ______ an umbrella. (were)","answers":["were you, I would take","was you, I would take","were you, I'd take","was you, I'd take"],"explanation":"Порада через тип 2: If I were you, I would take…"}$g603$, 104, $g604$cond_mix$g604$),
  ($g605$cond_ex10_1$g605$, $g606$abcd$g606$, $g607$intermediate$g607$, $g608${"id":"cond_ex10_1","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":1,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"1. You didn't watch the news so you didn't know there was a train strike. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I watched the news. If I watched the news, I would know there was a train strike.","B) I wish I had watched the news. If I watched the news, I would have known there was a train strike.","C) I wish I had watched the news. If I had watched the news, I would have known there was a train strike.","D) I wish I would watch the news. If I had watched the news, I would know there was a train strike."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Минуле: wish + Past Perfect, if + Past Perfect, наслідок would have + V3."}$g608$, 0, $g609$cond_wish$g609$),
  ($g610$cond_ex10_2$g610$, $g611$abcd$g611$, $g612$intermediate$g612$, $g613${"id":"cond_ex10_2","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":2,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"2. You work long hours and you can't spend much time with your family. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I hadn't worked long hours. If I hadn't worked long hours, I could have spent more time with my family.","B) I wish I wouldn't work long hours. If I didn't work long hours, I would spend more time with my family.","C) I wish I didn't work such long hours. If I didn't work long hours, I could spend more time with my family.","D) I wish I didn't work long hours. If I don't work long hours, I could spend more time with my family."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple, if + Past Simple, could/would + V. Про себе I wish I wouldn't не кажемо."}$g613$, 1, $g614$cond_wish$g614$),
  ($g615$cond_ex10_3$g615$, $g616$abcd$g616$, $g617$intermediate$g617$, $g618${"id":"cond_ex10_3","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":3,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"3. You wanted to travel abroad but you forgot to renew your passport. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I didn't forget to renew my passport. If I renewed my passport, I could travel abroad.","B) I wish I hadn't forgotten to renew my passport. If I renewed my passport, I could have travelled abroad.","C) I wish I hadn't forgotten to renew my passport. If I had renewed my passport, I could have travelled abroad.","D) I wish I wouldn't forget to renew my passport. If I had renewed my passport, I would travel abroad."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Минуле: Past Perfect в обох частинах. Wish і if-речення про одну ситуацію мають однаковий час: про минуле — Past Perfect, про теперішнє — Past Simple, у наслідку would/could."}$g618$, 2, $g619$cond_wish$g619$),
  ($g620$cond_ex10_4$g620$, $g621$abcd$g621$, $g622$intermediate$g622$, $g623${"id":"cond_ex10_4","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":4,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"4. You can't drive a car so you can't get around easily. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I can drive a car. If I can drive a car, I could get around easily.","B) I wish I could have driven a car. If I could have driven, I would have got around easily.","C) I wish I could drive a car. If I could drive a car, I could get around easily.","D) I wish I would drive a car. If I drove a car, I will get around easily."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Бракує вміння: wish + could. Нереальна умова теперішнього: If + could, could + V."}$g623$, 3, $g624$cond_wish$g624$),
  ($g625$cond_ex10_5$g625$, $g626$abcd$g626$, $g627$intermediate$g627$, $g628${"id":"cond_ex10_5","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":5,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"5. You wanted to play tennis but you broke your racquet. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I didn't break my racquet. If I didn't break my racquet, I could play tennis.","B) I wish I hadn't broken my racquet. If I didn't break my racquet, I could have played tennis.","C) I wish I hadn't broken my racquet. If I hadn't broken my racquet, I could have played tennis.","D) I wish I wouldn't break my racquet. If I hadn't broken it, I would play tennis."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Минуле: wish + Past Perfect, if + Past Perfect, наслідок could have + V3."}$g628$, 4, $g629$cond_wish$g629$),
  ($g630$cond_ex10_6$g630$, $g631$abcd$g631$, $g632$intermediate$g632$, $g633${"id":"cond_ex10_6","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":6,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"6. You want to go swimming but you have lost your swimming costume. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I didn't lose my swimming costume. If I didn't lose it, I could go swimming.","B) I wish I hadn't lost my swimming costume. If I hadn't lost it, I could have gone swimming.","C) I wish I hadn't lost my swimming costume. If I hadn't lost my swimming costume, I could go swimming.","D) I wish I haven't lost my swimming costume. If I haven't lost it, I can go swimming."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Втрата сталася в минулому (Past Perfect), а бажання поплавати — зараз, тому в наслідку could go. Це мішаний тип."}$g633$, 5, $g634$cond_wish$g634$),
  ($g635$cond_ex10_7$g635$, $g636$abcd$g636$, $g637$intermediate$g637$, $g638${"id":"cond_ex10_7","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":7,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"7. You want to climb the mountain but you are afraid of heights. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I hadn't been afraid of heights. If I hadn't been afraid of heights, I would have climbed the mountain.","B) I wish I wouldn't be afraid of heights. If I am not afraid of heights, I could climb the mountain.","C) I wish I weren't afraid of heights. If I weren't afraid of heights, I could climb the mountain.","D) I wish I am not afraid of heights. If I weren't afraid of heights, I can climb the mountain."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple (weren't / wasn't), if + Past Simple, could + V."}$g638$, 6, $g639$cond_wish$g639$),
  ($g640$cond_ex10_8$g640$, $g641$abcd$g641$, $g642$intermediate$g642$, $g643${"id":"cond_ex10_8","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":8,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"8. You didn't set your video correctly so you didn't record the film. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I set the video correctly. If I set the video correctly, I would record the film.","B) I wish I had set the video correctly. If I set the video correctly, I would have recorded the film.","C) I wish I had set the video correctly. If I had set the video correctly, I would have recorded the film.","D) I wish I would set the video correctly. If I had set it correctly, I would record the film."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Минуле: Past Perfect в обох частинах, наслідок would have + V3."}$g643$, 7, $g644$cond_wish$g644$),
  ($g645$cond_ex10_9$g645$, $g646$abcd$g646$, $g647$intermediate$g647$, $g648${"id":"cond_ex10_9","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":9,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"9. You want to go out tonight but you haven't got enough money. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I would have enough money. If I would have enough money, I could go out tonight.","B) I wish I had had enough money. If I had had enough money, I could go out tonight.","C) I wish I had enough money. If I had enough money, I could go out tonight.","D) I wish I have enough money. If I had enough money, I can go out tonight."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple, if + Past Simple, could + V. Would після if не вживаємо."}$g648$, 8, $g649$cond_wish$g649$),
  ($g650$cond_ex10_10$g650$, $g651$abcd$g651$, $g652$intermediate$g652$, $g653${"id":"cond_ex10_10","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":10,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"10. You want to cook an Italian meal but you have no pasta left. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I had had some pasta left. If I had had some pasta, I would cook an Italian meal.","B) I wish I would have some pasta left. If I will have pasta, I could cook an Italian meal.","C) I wish I had some pasta left. If I had some pasta left, I could cook an Italian meal.","D) I wish I have some pasta left. If I had pasta, I could have cooked an Italian meal."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple, if + Past Simple, could + V."}$g653$, 9, $g654$cond_wish$g654$),
  ($g655$cond_ex13_1$g655$, $g656$abcd$g656$, $g657$elementary$g657$, $g658${"id":"cond_ex13_1","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":1,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"1. If Bob hadn't broken his leg, …","options":["A) he could have come with us.","B) he can come with us.","C) he would come with us last week.","D) he will have come with us."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Тип 3: If + Past Perfect → would / could have + V3."}$g658$, 10, $g659$cond_unreal$g659$)
